    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZERO GRAVITY HEROES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 arcade challenges. 1 heroic mission.</strong><br>Land, jetpack, and shoot your way through 90 bite-sized stages across 30 unique missions.<br>Fast-paced, family-friendly action inspired by classic arcade gameplay \u2014 built for modern players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Universal Defense Grid has collapsed, scattering fragments of a lost galactic map across 30 perilous sectors.<br>As an Elite Quantum Pilot, you must complete three distinct challenges on each planet to recover the pieces and restore order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Lunar Lander</strong> \u2013 Master precision landing in descent challenges filled with hazards and tight tunnels.<br>\u2022 <strong>Jetpack Platforming</strong> \u2013 Navigate traps, scavenge fuel, and escape before time runs out.<br>\u2022 <strong>Top-Down Shooter</strong> \u2013 Blast through orbital defenses and evade hostile threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>3 Games in 1</strong> \u2013 Lander, Jetpack, and Shooter microgames in every level.<br>\u2022 <strong>90 Fast-Paced Stages</strong> \u2013 30 unique missions with 3 arcade-style stages each.<br>\u2022 <strong>Unlock the Final Mission</strong> \u2013 Collect 30 hidden puzzle pieces to restore the shattered cosmic map.<br>\u2022 <strong>Family-Friendly &amp; Accessible</strong> \u2013 No violence, no mature content \u2014 fun for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suit up and launch in.</strong><br>The galaxy needs a hero. Will it be you?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZERO GRAVITY HEROES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 arcade challenges. 1 heroic mission.</strong><br>Land, jetpack, and shoot your way through 90 bite-sized stages across 30 unique missions.<br>Fast-paced, family-friendly action inspired by classic arcade gameplay \u2014 built for modern players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Universal Defense Grid has collapsed, scattering fragments of a lost galactic map across 30 perilous sectors.<br>As an Elite Quantum Pilot, you must complete three distinct challenges on each planet to recover the pieces and restore order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Lunar Lander</strong> \u2013 Master precision landing in descent challenges filled with hazards and tight tunnels.<br>\u2022 <strong>Jetpack Platforming</strong> \u2013 Navigate traps, scavenge fuel, and escape before time runs out.<br>\u2022 <strong>Top-Down Shooter</strong> \u2013 Blast through orbital defenses and evade hostile threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>3 Games in 1</strong> \u2013 Lander, Jetpack, and Shooter microgames in every level.<br>\u2022 <strong>90 Fast-Paced Stages</strong> \u2013 30 unique missions with 3 arcade-style stages each.<br>\u2022 <strong>Unlock the Final Mission</strong> \u2013 Collect 30 hidden puzzle pieces to restore the shattered cosmic map.<br>\u2022 <strong>Family-Friendly &amp; Accessible</strong> \u2013 No violence, no mature content \u2014 fun for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suit up and launch in.</strong><br>The galaxy needs a hero. Will it be you?</p>",
